# Host-side port for the bot's webhook listener (container side always stays 8999).
# Only needed if you run a second stack (e.g. a test bot) alongside this one on
# the same host, to avoid "port is already allocated". Leave unset for normal use.
# BOT_EXTERNAL_PORT=8998